+.. function:: qualname(obj)
+
+    Returns the fully qualified dotted path of a class or function, as
+    ``"<module>.<qualname>"``. Raises :exc:`TypeError` if ``obj`` is not a
+    class or function. For example::
+
+        from django.utils.module_loading import qualname
+
+        qualname(ValidationError)  # 'django.core.exceptions.ValidationError'
